TI  - A histological study of the organogenesis of the digestive system in bay snook Petenia splendida Günther, 1862 from hatching to the juvenile stage
PY  - 2011
T2  - Journal of Applied Ichthyology
VL  - 27
IS  - 1
SP  - 73
